@baseUrl = http://47.97.46.242/api/v1
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
@userToken = replace-with-user-access-token
@orderId = replace-with-order-uuid
@shipmentId = replace-with-shipment-uuid

### Company dropdown (orders:ship)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/logistics/carriers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Ship a paid order. Use the latest order version and a new unique idempotency key.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/shipment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: replace-with-unique-key-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"carrierCode":"ZTO","trackingNo":"CSDEMO123456","orderVersion":2,"phoneLast4":"1234"}

### Customer: own order only; refreshes expired cache
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/logistics
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Administrator: orders:read
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/logistics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Correct before pickup. After pickup, keep number/carrier and only correct phoneLast4.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/shipments/{{shipmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"carrierCode":"ZTO","trackingNo":"CSDEMO123456","phoneLast4":"4321","reason":"cs修正查询尾号"}

### Explicit refresh: latest shipment.version; at least 60 seconds since last query
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":2}
